    <briefdescription>
<para>Size or dimension mismatch error. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><ref refid="classcslt_1_1SizeMismatchError" kindref="compound">SizeMismatchError</ref> represents an error when dimensions or sizes of objects don&apos;t match as required for an operation.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="par"><title>Example Usage:</title><para><programlisting><codeline><highlight class="normal">throw<sp/>SizeMismatchError();<sp/><sp/>//<sp/>&quot;Dimension/size<sp/>mismatch&quot;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">throw<sp/>SizeMismatchError(&quot;Matrix<sp/>dimensions<sp/>incompatible:<sp/>3x4<sp/>and<sp/>2x3&quot;);</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting> </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
